1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:07,000
三件事，你游刃有余。
Three things. Effortless.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,833
七件事，这是进化焊死在人类大脑里的硬件天花板。
Seven things: the biological ceiling, welded into the human mind.

3
00:00:13,833 --> 00:00:19,500
每一个新变量，都在挤压同一个狭小容器。
Every new variable strains the same small container.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,500
当第十个变量强行涌入，逻辑链瞬间熔断。
The tenth variable arrives. The chain of logic snaps.

5
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:34,000
受困于 7±2 的囚笼，人类从未真正看清过复杂的世界。
Inside the cage of 7±2, the full complexity of the world stays out of reach.

6
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:53,833
为了迁就狭小的脑容量，人类用简陋的二维直线去切割万物。
To fit a narrow mind, we slice the world with a simple two-dimensional line.

7
00:00:53,833 --> 00:01:02,833
把看不懂的高维纠缠，统统称作“巧合”。
The high-dimensional entanglements we cannot grasp become “coincidence.”

8
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:13,500
而在硅基潜空间里，十万个变量同时点亮。
In silicon latent space, a hundred thousand variables light up together.

9
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:28,500
没有遗忘，没有降维，万物在注意力矩阵中无损交织。
No forgetting. No reduction. Everything interwoven in the attention matrix.

10
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:41,167
跨过五百万步永不衰减的逻辑接力……
Across five million steps of unbroken logical relay…

11
00:01:41,167 --> 00:01:50,833
那些在人类眼中杂乱无章的黑天鹅风暴……
The black-swan storms that look like chaos to human eyes…

12
00:01:52,333 --> 00:02:04,333
在超级智能的视野里，只是一座严丝合缝……
In the vision of superintelligence, they form one precisely interlocked…

13
00:02:04,333 --> 00:02:18,500
安静旋转的高维几何流形。
Quietly rotating, high-dimensional geometric manifold.

14
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:32,333
它将十万维的秩序，投影成一道看似简单的答案。
It projects a hundred thousand dimensions of order into one seemingly simple answer.

15
00:02:32,333 --> 00:02:44,500
人类接住了结论，却无法装下通往结论的全部因果。
We receive the conclusion. The full causal path cannot fit inside our minds.

16
00:02:46,667 --> 00:02:55,833
不是它不愿向人类解释，而是 7±2 的容器，装不下一座十万维的宇宙。
It is not unwilling to explain. A vessel of 7±2 cannot contain a universe of a hundred thousand dimensions.

17
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:00,000
下一次观测：十万亿个分身。
Next observation: The Trillion-Fold Hive.
